# Trait Doctoring replaces the basic land type Swamp with Island in Urborg's text until end of turn (CR 612.1), so
# "Each land is a Swamp in addition to its other land types" says Island: Urborg and Bot2's Forest are Islands, not
# Swamps, and Urborg taps for {U} (CR 305.6). Urborg is still called Urborg (CR 612.2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth
Trait Doctoring
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth.Play
? Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Subtypes = Forest; Swamp
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate(Ability: Add {U})
Bot1.Hand.Trait Doctoring.Cast(Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Replace a basic land type)
Bot1.Modes(Swamp)
Bot1.Modes(Island)
Bot1.Battlefield.Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {U}

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Subtypes = Forest; Island
Bot1.Battlefield.Urborg, Tomb of Yawgmoth.Subtypes = Island
